## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **426** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 3,284,622 (baseline) -> 3,277,550 (model, -7,072) -> 3,221,135 (null, -63,487). The null DB displaces 56,415 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 3,283,620 vs null 3,232,585.

